spec('ulmecatl',('One giant man with one head, two arms and two legs, fully opaque plain woven long tunic and mantle, no invented crown weapons or deity attributes',['c01','c03','c04']),('No documented magic; towering founding giant strides over ground with dust from his footstep, establishing settlement after flood',['c01','c02']),('Land of Cuetlachoapan, future Puebla, after Great Flood; tiny distant trees and plain low dwellings for giant scale',['c01','c02','c06']),('awe-inspiring ancestral giant, dignified',['c01','c02']),'Stride down toward viewer with forward hand extended over tiny land below, tunic hem pulled by wind, enormous foot landing in foreground. Head and shoulders dominate above distant trees.','Ulmecatl the giant ancestral founder',['Giant scale documented. Plain fully opaque woven clothing, dark flood-damp soil and distant plain dwellings are neutral editorial staging, no invented Aztec symbols or pyramids. No magic.'],surface='weathered skin, thick woven opaque mantle, damp soil',light='one low amber sun breaking over storm horizon')
spec('ura',('One intact roaring humanlike oni head, two eyes, one mouth, left eye clouded from arrow injury without any wound blood or arrows; no body neck shoulders or gore',['c01','c03','c06']),('The head remains alive and roars after capture; air-driven dust and loose dry leaves scatter beneath it, no flames beams or aura',['c06']),('Dark Kibi ground near where head was displayed, entirely plain backdrop with no architecture',['c02','c05','c06']),('menacing roaring oni spirit',['c05','c06']),'Roar directly toward viewer, mouth wide open, brow tense, hair whipping; intact living head suspended above shadowed ground, lower edge hidden by deep shadow, no cut surface visible.','living roaring head of Ura after defeat',['Non-gory interpretation of documented enduring head; no severing scene, blood, neck stump or wounds. Natural face design editorial, no invented horns or weapons.'],surface='weathered skin, tangled dark hair, wet teeth, dry leaves',light='one low amber side light')
